# --- Owner-supplied source material: PRIVATE, never commit ---
# Contains the CV (full name, phone, home address, employer detail), certificates,
# hospital project photographs, SCADA field photographs of identifiable people, and
# the un-redacted posters carrying a bank account number, account holder name and
# personal messaging handles. Inventory: CONTENT_INVENTORY.md (ignored, see below).
raw-files/

# --- Working scratch: page renders of private documents, screenshots, one-off scripts ---
.scratch/

# --- Internal content review: PRIVATE, never commit ---
# These are the owner-facing audit notes behind the site. They enumerate every
# source file in raw-files/, name the institutions and people in the photographs
# that were deliberately withheld, and record which items are still pending
# permission. Keep them on disk as working notes, out of the public repository.
CONTENT_INVENTORY.md
ASSET_REVIEW.md

# --- Visual audit screenshots (keep direction.json, it is the art-direction source of truth) ---
.taste-skill/inspect/

